Package: pbn
Title: House Layout and Checks for Analysis Projects
Version: 2026.12.6
Authors@R:
    c(
      person(
        given = c("Richard", "Aubrey"),
        family = "White",
        email = "hello@rwhite.no",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6747-1726")
      )
    )
Description: Holds the house layout of a versioned analysis project and
    the checks of that layout. It runs the real data and fake scenarios
    as one 'plnr' plan, with a seed for each simulation, writes one
    results object for each scenario and simulation with a fixed
    contract, checks the fake scenarios against their expected values, and
    computes the numbers of a descriptive table. It checks the bias, the
    standard error and the coverage of an estimate over the simulations of
    a fake scenario against limits from their Monte Carlo standard errors
    (Morris, White and Crowther, 2019, <doi:10.1002/sim.8086>).
